# CQ 16：哪些事件的現行有效決策（排除已取代、已否決、已放棄）涉及某法規條款？（以 GDPR Art. 33 為例）
# 現行有效＝未被取代，且狀態屬於 ds:DecisionProgression（Exploring、Decided、Implemented）
PREFIX rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>
PREFIX tf:   <https://anniechiang-data.framer.website/ontology/talentflow#>
PREFIX tfs:  <https://anniechiang-data.framer.website/ontology/talentflow-sample#>
PREFIX ds:   <https://anniechiang-data.framer.website/vocab/decision-status#>

SELECT ?event ?decisionLabel ?statusLabel WHERE {
  ?event tf:hasDecision ?decision .
  ?decision tf:basedOnRegulation tfs:gdprArt33 ;
            rdfs:label ?decisionLabel ;
            tf:hasDecisionStatus ?status .
  ds:DecisionProgression skos:memberList/rdf:rest*/rdf:first ?status .
  FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?newer tf:supersedes ?decision }
  ?status skos:prefLabel ?statusLabel .
  FILTER(LANGMATCHES(LANG(?decisionLabel), "en"))
  FILTER(LANGMATCHES(LANG(?statusLabel), "en"))
} ORDER BY ?event
